cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Balanced Weight Routing in research, please cite this repository."
title: "Balanced Weight Routing: Verified Residual Routing for Efficient Local LLM Inference"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Kanth"
    given-names: "Chaman Prakash"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ChamanPrakashKanth/Balanced-Weight-Routing"
url: "https://github.com/ChamanPrakashKanth/Balanced-Weight-Routing"
abstract: >-
  An experimental framework for routing tasks across heterogeneous local language
  models using external verification and residual task difficulty, with the goal
  of reducing inference cost while preserving verified task success.
keywords:
  - "LLM routing"
  - "model cascade"
  - "verified inference"
  - "local LLM"
  - "adaptive routing"
  - "inference efficiency"
  - "small language models"
